{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:580a65fd8e1afe28","name":"Naval Officer Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-580a65fd8e1afe28","title":"Naval Officer Talent Tree","revision":26908,"timestamp":"2025-08-04T14:19:06Z","sha256":"9382c6e7af9abdfdc9b2e360d9fde81c42740e82b87c8fb9c13176be3e59edce","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26908","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Naval%20Officer%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-580a65fd8e1afe28","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are skilled at commanding ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"}," and small fleets.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Combined Fire"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you may designate a single creature, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," or object within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," as the target of ",{"tag":"b","children":["Combined Fire"]},". Any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Batteries"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Batteries"}," attacking the target deal an extra die of damage for every 2 points by which their attack roll exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," (instead of every 3 points).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In addition, when using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tactical Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tactical_Fire"}," option for a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"},", you may designated a weapon or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Battery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Battery"}," to make a single attack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Fleet Deployment"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite: "]},{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," 13\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", you can designate a number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Officer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Officer","referenceId":"reference:192135a8adabe174"}," Class Level and within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". Those ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," may immediately move a number of squares equal to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Fleet Tactics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," 13, ",{"tag":"b","children":["Fleet Deployment"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you may designate a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," as the target of a large-scale assault. If you succeed on a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Tactics)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Tactics)"}," check, all allied ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"}," within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," deal 1 additional die of damage to the target with each successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," until the start of your next turn. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["It's a Trap!"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You are skilled at sensing the plans of enemy naval ",{"tag":"a","children":["Officers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Officers"},", and counteracting them. Once per encounter as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", you can grant the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of any single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," (including a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," you are commanding) an immediate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Legendary Commander"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," 13, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," 13, ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Born Leader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Born_Leader"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Commander"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Commander","referenceId":"reference:16af7be312e1840b"}," of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"},", calculate its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," using your Heroic Level plus one-half the ship's armor bonus (rounded down), the Vehicle Pilot's Heroic Level, or the ship's Armor bonus, whichever is highest.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In addition, all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"}," on your ship add one-half your Heroic Level, or one-half their Heroic Level, whichever is more, to damage rolls with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Weapons"},". Finally, you treat any generic crew as being one quality level higher (maximum of Ace, see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Crew Quality"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crew_Quality","referenceId":"reference:c79e9b6530a86284"},").\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
